WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
This sixth day of the Satipatthana course is over.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Let us proceed further.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Beware with Dhammanupassana.

00:20.000 --> 00:32.000
We had covered the Nivaran Pabbam,

00:36.000 --> 00:46.000
the five obstacles on the progress of the path of Dhamma, the path of liberation.

00:50.000 --> 00:55.000
We move further.

00:56.000 --> 00:59.000
Dhamma, as I said,

